  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tola na Yairi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’Abimeleki, Tola, mosinto o Pua o Dodo, omonto bw’egesaku gia Isakaru, akaimoka gotooria Abaisraeli. Ere nigo amenyete Samiri, ase ense y’ebitunwa ya Efraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akagambeera Abaisraeli ebiina ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo ebere, n’etato. Erio agakwa, agatindekwa agwo Samiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega yaye Yairi Omogileadi akaimoka. Nere akabagambera Abaisraeli ebiina ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo ebere, n’ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo abwate abana abamura emerongo etato, baare koriina chitigere emerongo etato. Boigo bakaba bakogambera emechie emerongo etato agwo ase ense ya Gileadi. Emechie eyio nigo ekorokwa Hawoti‐Yairi (Emechie ya Yairi) nonya ngoika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairi agakwa, agatindekwa agwo Kamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti n’Abaamoni bagochaanda Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe ase obosio bw’Omonene; bagasasiima chinyasae chiria chiare korokwa Baali, na echinde chiare korokwa Asitaroti, amo ne’chinyasae chi’Abasiiria, n’Abasidoni, n’Abamoabu, n’Abaamoni, n’Abafilisti; naende bagatiga komokorera Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akaba n’endamwamu enene ase Abaisraeli, akababeeka ase amaboko y’Abafilisti na ay’Abaamoni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka oria barabwo bagachaanda Abaisraeli na kobakorera bobe. Ase engaki y’emiaka ikomi, na etano n’etato, bagachaanda Abaisraeli bonsi abamenyete moocha y’orooche rwa Yorodani ase ense y’Abaamoni ase Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nayio, Abaamoni bakaamboka Yorodani gochia korwania Abayuda, n’Ababenjamini, n’Abaefraimu, goika Abaisraeli bagaachaandwa bobe mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abaisraeli bakarera ase Omonene, bagoteeba, “Twakorire ebibe ase ore, ekiagera twagotigire aye Nyasae oito, na gokorera chinyasae chiria Baali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akabairaneria, “Inee! Tinababooretie korwa ase Abamisiri, n’Abaamoni, n’Abafilisti?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Abasidoni, n’Abaameleki, n’Abaamoni, abwo bonsi mbaabachaandete; mokarera ase ’nde, na inche ’nkabatooria korwa ase amaboko abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bono mwantigire inche na gokorera chinyasae ching’ao; ase ayio tintageti kobatooria naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda, morere ase chinyasae chiria mogokorera, tiga chirochio chibatoorie bono ekero more ase emechando.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abaisraeli bagateebia Omonene, “Twakorire ebibe, na bono tokorere buna oranche aye omonyene; twagosoroire, ototoorie reero, koranche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo bakarusia na gotuguta chinyasae chingeni echiarenge ase egati yabo, bagakorera Omonene. Na b’Omonene tare konyaara koremereria naende korora emechando y’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaamoni bakarangerigwa goocha korwana, bagatoora agwo Gileadi, korende Abaisraeli bagasangererigwa, bagatoora agwo Misipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Gileadi na abatang’ani babo bagakwana barabwo ase barabwo, “Ning’o oranche gochaaka korwania Abaamoni? Ere oyio nabe omogambi bw’ abanto bonsi ba Gileadi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
